(3476794, 486620, 53316, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. I love the tilted elements, and the fact that not all of the face is visible.</td>', 'Brilliant. I love the tilted elements, and the fact that not all of the face is visible.', '2007-03-21 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476796, 484218, 53316, '<td valign="top">Normally I would not care for these color tones for a person but it chillingly works here.</td>', 'Normally I would not care for these color tones for a person but it chillingly works here.', '2007-03-21 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476817, 484404, 53316, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this is backstage at an Easter event... because even before looking at the title I was like "JESUS?" So yeah... to see Jesus on a cell phone is awesome.</td>', 'I am assuming this is backstage at an Easter event... because even before looking at the title I was like "JESUS?" So yeah... to see Jesus on a cell phone is awesome.', '2007-03-21 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476819, 486506, 53316, '<td valign="top">Stunning. A bit grainy, but that isn''t a huge deal (mostly it is noticable to me on the bottom right). A really great photo.</td>', 'Stunning. A bit grainy, but that isn''t a huge deal (mostly it is noticable to me on the bottom right). A really great photo.', '2007-03-21 00:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476829, 486545, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well aren''t the boys just going to go nuts over those panties. :-)  I really like the composition although the image overall is a little flat to me.</td>', 'Well aren''t the boys just going to go nuts over those panties. :-)  I really like the composition although the image overall is a little flat to me.', '2007-03-21 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476841, 486035, 53316, '<td valign="top">Fantasic facial expression.</td>', 'Fantasic facial expression.', '2007-03-21 00:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476867, 485966, 15511, '<td valign="top">Everything''s just a bit out of focus...</td>', 'Everything''s just a bit out of focus...', '2007-03-21 00:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476874, 485305, 74862, '<td valign="top">taken with a cell phone?</td>', 'taken with a cell phone?', '2007-03-21 00:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476881, 486543, 74862, '<td valign="top">ha, I see this in Vancouver all the time - I would have marked it higher if it were a bit clearer</td>', 'ha, I see this in Vancouver all the time - I would have marked it higher if it were a bit clearer', '2007-03-21 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476894, 486215, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love abstracts, and this one is done nicely.. the flowing composition is very peaceful. And I can believe that it was made with a cell phone light.  So... hm. At first I was thinking that this is not a person using their phone, and was commenting to tell you that my low vote would be from that, and not bias against abstracts. However... in order to have that pattern, there must be a person using the phone to make it.  "Using" doesn''t mean "talking on". So my initial perception is out the window and I am pleased to give you a high score.</td>', 'I love abstracts, and this one is done nicely.. the flowing composition is very peaceful. And I can believe that it was made with a cell phone light.  So... hm. At first I was thinking that this is not a person using their phone, and was commenting to tell you that my low vote would be from that, and not bias against abstracts. However... in order to have that pattern, there must be a person using the phone to make it.  "Using" doesn''t mean "talking on". So my initial perception is out the window and I am pleased to give you a high score.', '2007-03-21 00:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476895, 486581, 74862, '<td valign="top">nice clarity on the people in the restaurant</td>', 'nice clarity on the people in the restaurant', '2007-03-21 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476900, 485305, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think this will be very interesting if it turns out to be captured on a cell phone camera.</td>', 'I think this will be very interesting if it turns out to be captured on a cell phone camera.', '2007-03-21 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476902, 486608, 74862, '<td valign="top">nice photo - but I think some contrast and dropping the brightness would have made it even better</td>', 'nice photo - but I think some contrast and dropping the brightness would have made it even better', '2007-03-21 00:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
