(3483561, 486173, 54674, '<td valign="top">I hope you weren''t talking on there when that happened!   <br/> <br/>Good idea, good DOF.   Composition OK &amp; fits rule of 3''s etc.    Something about the lighting seems to miss the mark for me.  Distracting element in lower right corner.   - 7</td>', 'I hope you weren''t talking on there when that happened!    Good idea, good DOF.   Composition OK & fits rule of 3''s etc.    Something about the lighting seems to miss the mark for me.  Distracting element in lower right corner.   - 7', '2007-03-23 14:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
