(3483568, 486639, 67237, '<td valign="top">white bg does not seem to be the best for the intended dramatic mood. besides I think a real "WHAT!?!"  produces some additional tension this shot does not show. I would try putting the camera a bit lower to have a better perspective of the hands, forming a triangle with the face, but that is just my opinnion.. what do I know?</td>', 'white bg does not seem to be the best for the intended dramatic mood. besides I think a real "WHAT!?!"  produces some additional tension this shot does not show. I would try putting the camera a bit lower to have a better perspective of the hands, forming a triangle with the face, but that is just my opinnion.. what do I know?', '2007-03-23 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483573, 486504, 54674, '<td valign="top">Try overexpose +1 to get whites in the snow.  Subject doesn''t stand out for me but nice capture of the action.   - 6</td>', 'Try overexpose +1 to get whites in the snow.  Subject doesn''t stand out for me but nice capture of the action.   - 6', '2007-03-23 14:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
