(3483596, 486498, 54674, '<td valign="top">Definitely intense, attention grabbing and has some feeling.   Hard to tell where whiskers end and face begins.   - 9</td>', 'Definitely intense, attention grabbing and has some feeling.   Hard to tell where whiskers end and face begins.   - 9', '2007-03-23 14:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483611, 486499, 7252, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but where''s the phone?</td>', 'Nice photo but where''s the phone?', '2007-03-23 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483616, 486466, 73575, '<td valign="top">Very funny! I had my boss put me on hold last week and eventually hung up; he called back 45 minutes after first putting me on hold. "He''s like the thing that wouldn''t shut up!" The man does not know how to get off the phone.<br/>Picturewise, it looks like you have two lights, an overhead to the left and a window or maybe monitor on the right; this is causing the left side to look yellowed and the right is bluish. I like the highlights from the overhead, but a more even and uniform lighting &amp; coloring would improve this a lot.<br/>I like the composition; however in scrolling up and down I think I like it more with the top cropped so the eye sockets are about 1/3 down (cut just where the right side of the hat starts to go straight up); this also makes the overall proportions more aesthetic - or traditional/boring if you did it on purpose, but it seems too tall to me.</td>', 'Very funny! I had my boss put me on hold last week and eventually hung up; he called back 45 minutes after first putting me on hold. "He''s like the thing that wouldn''t shut up!" The man does not know how to get off the phone.Picturewise, it looks like you have two lights, an overhead to the left and a window or maybe monitor on the right; this is causing the left side to look yellowed and the right is bluish. I like the highlights from the overhead, but a more even and uniform lighting & coloring would improve this a lot.I like the composition; however in scrolling up and down I think I like it more with the top cropped so the eye sockets are about 1/3 down (cut just where the right side of the hat starts to go straight up); this also makes the overall proportions more aesthetic - or traditional/boring if you did it on purpose, but it seems too tall to me.', '2007-03-23 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483618, 486499, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope people aren''t saying to you - ''Hey, that''s a brick, not a cell phone''. Too funny, I remember those AND had one. Well, not that one but your know...10</td>', 'I hope people aren''t saying to you - ''Hey, that''s a brick, not a cell phone''. Too funny, I remember those AND had one. Well, not that one but your know...10', '2007-03-23 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483619, 486400, 7252, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors but I''m not understanding the goofy expression.</td>', 'Nice rich colors but I''m not understanding the goofy expression.', '2007-03-23 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483623, 485006, 73575, '<td valign="top">All the better because I had a professor answer his phone in class recently - twice in the same class. I wonder who''s on his speed dial? :) Decent composition, I like the how the details stand out on the pulpit.<br/>...But why is the one organ pipe above his head shiny-er? (sorry I can''t spell that right now...) That and the microphone stand over his left shoulder are quite distracting.</td>', 'All the better because I had a professor answer his phone in class recently - twice in the same class. I wonder who''s on his speed dial? :) Decent composition, I like the how the details stand out on the pulpit....But why is the one organ pipe above his head shiny-er? (sorry I can''t spell that right now...) That and the microphone stand over his left shoulder are quite distracting.', '2007-03-23 14:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483630, 486609, 62187, '<td valign="top">If you would have included a hand or even a finger in the photo, I''d have given it a 10.</td>', 'If you would have included a hand or even a finger in the photo, I''d have given it a 10.', '2007-03-23 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483631, 485109, 73575, '<td valign="top">great combination of the challenge and DPC in general; the dog really adds a lot to this! The black background is a little overbearing though; I''d like to see this against a white wall like he''s on the sofa at home, maybe with the lower corner of a picture sticking into the upper right corner for some balance and a sense of surroundings.</td>', 'great combination of the challenge and DPC in general; the dog really adds a lot to this! The black background is a little overbearing though; I''d like to see this against a white wall like he''s on the sofa at home, maybe with the lower corner of a picture sticking into the upper right corner for some balance and a sense of surroundings.', '2007-03-23 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3483633, 486458, 54674, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot but flash photography is not great lighting in a contest like this unless it''s diffused or reflected.   - 5</td>', 'Cute snapshot but flash photography is not great lighting in a contest like this unless it''s diffused or reflected.   - 5', '2007-03-23 14:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
