(3484713, 486604, 45566, '<td valign="top">It''s a technically good photo, Nice use of DOF to isolate the subject, I quite like the lighting.  It''s just a little... plain (sorry)</td>', 'It''s a technically good photo, Nice use of DOF to isolate the subject, I quite like the lighting.  It''s just a little... plain (sorry)', '2007-03-24 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484714, 486643, 45566, '<td valign="top">I''m torn between "ewww" and laughing aloud.  Nice pic though</td>', 'I''m torn between "ewww" and laughing aloud.  Nice pic though', '2007-03-24 01:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484719, 485520, 45566, '<td valign="top">There were always going to be a thousand shots of a person on a phone for this challenge, but I like this.  For me, the change of camera position, and the way the lighting works helps raise it from the others.</td>', 'There were always going to be a thousand shots of a person on a phone for this challenge, but I like this.  For me, the change of camera position, and the way the lighting works helps raise it from the others.', '2007-03-24 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484723, 485240, 45566, '<td valign="top">wow.  I love it. (not very helpful I know.. but it''s a fantastic shot)</td>', 'wow.  I love it. (not very helpful I know.. but it''s a fantastic shot)', '2007-03-24 01:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484727, 486592, 45566, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit cluttered up in the top left, and the lighting (on camera flash?)  seems a bit one sided.  <br/> <br/>Nice smile, but I would have preferred to see the shot taken one step to your right, so we could see the whole face</td>', 'The background is a bit cluttered up in the top left, and the lighting (on camera flash?)  seems a bit one sided.   Nice smile, but I would have preferred to see the shot taken one step to your right, so we could see the whole face', '2007-03-24 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484729, 486518, 45566, '<td valign="top">I like the concept... but I hate the cuddly toy.  No joy in my soul, I think thats my problem ;)</td>', 'I like the concept... but I hate the cuddly toy.  No joy in my soul, I think thats my problem ;)', '2007-03-24 02:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484730, 485686, 45566, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, like the way the none of the lines are actually perpendicular to the framing.  Great to see a shot that isn''t the normal headshot of someone chatting on the phone</td>', 'I love the composition, like the way the none of the lines are actually perpendicular to the framing.  Great to see a shot that isn''t the normal headshot of someone chatting on the phone', '2007-03-24 02:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3484733, 486298, 45566, '<td valign="top">This is going to sound petty, so I apologise.  <br/>I do like the picture, and the idea behind it.  But I *hate* the title.</td>', 'This is going to sound petty, so I apologise.  I do like the picture, and the idea behind it.  But I *hate* the title.', '2007-03-24 02:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
