(3484740, 486338, 45566, '<td valign="top">love it, love it, love it!<br/>perfectly captures the sense of rushing around, the incessant pace of modern life that cell phones curse us with.</td>', 'love it, love it, love it!perfectly captures the sense of rushing around, the incessant pace of modern life that cell phones curse us with.', '2007-03-24 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
