(3486729, 486466, 62787, '<td valign="top">lol! I like that :) Having phoned up enough customer care centres, I can sympathise...<br/> <br/>I think there might be a better way of adjusting the lighting though. I''d like to see his face lit up, so I think light coming in from top right would''ve helped.</td>', 'lol! I like that :) Having phoned up enough customer care centres, I can sympathise... I think there might be a better way of adjusting the lighting though. I''d like to see his face lit up, so I think light coming in from top right would''ve helped.', '2007-03-25 09:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3486730, 485112, 62787, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! Good idea, well executed, I love the light and the model''s expression.</td>', 'Fantastic shot! Good idea, well executed, I love the light and the model''s expression.', '2007-03-25 10:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
