(3487181, 486592, 10858, '<td valign="top">Harsh lights on the face, busy background and lack of conscious composition. Shame, because her blond hair, turquoise clothes and cherry colour phone would work well if lighting and composition was set up properly.</td>', 'Harsh lights on the face, busy background and lack of conscious composition. Shame, because her blond hair, turquoise clothes and cherry colour phone would work well if lighting and composition was set up properly.', '2007-03-25 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3487182, 485967, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is a quite bad quality photo (complression, cromatic aberration)... You filled the frame well with crowd, but hardly any cell phone to be seen here. The girl looking here with black hair could be put to a rule-of-thirds point. She should hold the mobile and you could crop a bit tighter as well.</td>', 'This is a quite bad quality photo (complression, cromatic aberration)... You filled the frame well with crowd, but hardly any cell phone to be seen here. The girl looking here with black hair could be put to a rule-of-thirds point. She should hold the mobile and you could crop a bit tighter as well.', '2007-03-25 17:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3487187, 485972, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is noisy (high ISO level of not enough lights), lighting is bad and the background was not chosen well. The angle is nice, but a good object photo should have proper lighting and photo quality.</td>', 'This is noisy (high ISO level of not enough lights), lighting is bad and the background was not chosen well. The angle is nice, but a good object photo should have proper lighting and photo quality.', '2007-03-25 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3487228, 486295, 76023, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very soft, but dramatic.  It also looks like part of a Sci Fi channel comercial!  Its a very well done photograph!</td>', 'The lighting is very soft, but dramatic.  It also looks like part of a Sci Fi channel comercial!  Its a very well done photograph!', '2007-03-25 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
