(3489003, 486338, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this for the challenge.  It shows "people" actually using a cell phone and it doesn''t appear to be a contrived/setup image.  Good sense of movement and a balanced composition.  Some may like to see more of the faces but I think it works just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this for the challenge.  It shows "people" actually using a cell phone and it doesn''t appear to be a contrived/setup image.  Good sense of movement and a balanced composition.  Some may like to see more of the faces but I think it works just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-26 14:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3489005, 484736, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see an image of someone actually using a cellphone for real.  I like the movement and the business of the photo (person ''On the Go'').  Does seem a little underexposed/dark.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s nice to see an image of someone actually using a cellphone for real.  I like the movement and the business of the photo (person ''On the Go'').  Does seem a little underexposed/dark.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-26 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
