(3492635, 486175, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like the USM might have been a bit too much - there''s just a bit of a feeling of being too overprocessed. But I gave it a good vote - I think your concept was really strong and the composition was nice.  Also, yay for auto levels! :-)</td>', 'Seems like the USM might have been a bit too much - there''s just a bit of a feeling of being too overprocessed. But I gave it a good vote - I think your concept was really strong and the composition was nice.  Also, yay for auto levels! :-)', '2007-03-28 01:26:50.000000', NULL, 0),
