(3494286, 486190, 66384, '<td valign="top">I thought this was your daughter. I''m getting to know your family quite well. Two nice daughter shots in one week. Well done. I like the simple, coordinated colors in this shot. The touch of red (shorts) is nice in the otherwise aqua/green shot. Very cute pose, and the lighting and focus are excellent -- I like the soft focus on her face. I''m fascinated by her feet -- all tensed up, and sooooo clean.</td>', 'I thought this was your daughter. I''m getting to know your family quite well. Two nice daughter shots in one week. Well done. I like the simple, coordinated colors in this shot. The touch of red (shorts) is nice in the otherwise aqua/green shot. Very cute pose, and the lighting and focus are excellent -- I like the soft focus on her face. I''m fascinated by her feet -- all tensed up, and sooooo clean.', '2007-03-28 14:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
