(3593073, 486539, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Glad you made the top twenty.  For some reason I found myself thinking about this photo last night.  The preparation that went into it is fascinating (I''ve now saved this and the two set-up shots to my favorites).<br/> <br/>I generally evaluate photos and not the captions, but I wonder if a different caption might have improved your ranking.  It''s funny in an "insider joke" kind of way, but as a newcomer I found the caption confusing (and still do, in a way).  Just my two cents on that.  Cheers, and keep up the good work!</td>', 'Great photo.  Glad you made the top twenty.  For some reason I found myself thinking about this photo last night.  The preparation that went into it is fascinating (I''ve now saved this and the two set-up shots to my favorites). I generally evaluate photos and not the captions, but I wonder if a different caption might have improved your ranking.  It''s funny in an "insider joke" kind of way, but as a newcomer I found the caption confusing (and still do, in a way).  Just my two cents on that.  Cheers, and keep up the good work!', '2007-04-29 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3637339, 486466, 65435, '<td valign="top">Love it! I''ve been a switchboard operator for almost 24 years. This is PERFECT!!! &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Love it! I''ve been a switchboard operator for almost 24 years. This is PERFECT!!! <g>', '2007-05-10 15:17:09.000000', NULL, 0),
