(3673082, 486499, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>This is great FUN!</b> <br/> <br/>At any rate, Congratulations on your consistent showing on DPC. I will continue to watch you for pointers on how to improve.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-24 10:40:34.</i></td>', 'This is great FUN!  At any rate, Congratulations on your consistent showing on DPC. I will continue to watch you for pointers on how to improve.  :)', '2007-05-21 07:53:50.000000', '2007-05-24 11:40:34.000000', 0),
